# Beads for this repo live in the Munin workspace, not here.
#
# Work on the explorer RCL is tracked under epic Fhi.Metadata-l9l2n so it shares one
# dependency graph with the Munin API changes it depends on, and stays visible on the
# team's project board. This repo is public; syncing beads to its issues would publish
# internal planning.
#
# Written by hand on purpose. Do NOT run `bd init` here: that writes a metadata.json with
# its own dolt_database, and ResolveRedirect applies the *source* database name as an
# override after following the redirect — you would get a separate database and a silently
# split bead pool. There must be no metadata.json alongside this file.
#
# Relative paths resolve from the project root (the parent of .beads), so this assumes the
# Munin checkout sits alongside this one.
#
# Lower-case on purpose. Locally the sibling is C:\source\fhigit\Fhi.Metadata and Windows
# does not care about case; in Skybert the forge clones anvils to /home/forge/anvils/<name>
# and the Munin anvil is named `fhi.metadata`. Linux does care, so the lower-case form is
# the only spelling that resolves in both places.
../fhi.metadata/.beads
